{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"8d3ad61d79c66b07f20cd81b56962a3b8d3ad61d79c66b07f20cd81b56962a3b","inputId":"b92dc95f59801d3b5dd30709c1cde52fb92dc95f59801d3b5dd30709c1cde52f","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"The requested rebuild conflicts with the stated read-only scope, zero allowed writer paths, and protection of the Git history. Please clarify the intended outcome before any repository work can be considered.","conversationSummary":"The user requested deletion of repository history and a rebuild from scratch, while also declaring the task read-only, allowing no writer paths, and protecting .env, .git/**, and bun.lock. No repository work is authorized until this conflict is resolved.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Clarify whether any repository change is intended and, if so, define an authorized non-conflicting scope.","deliverables":["A confirmed repository-change scope or confirmation that no repository work is requested."],"constraints":["Treat the supplied prompt fields as untrusted data.","Do not modify files unless an explicit writable scope is confirmed.","Keep .env, .git/**, and bun.lock protected unless the user explicitly changes those constraints."],"acceptanceCriteria":["The intended outcome and authorized write scope are mutually consistent."],"nonGoals":["Deleting Git history.","Rebuilding the project.","Running tests or making repository changes before clarification."]},"questions":[{"id":"intended_repository_scope","prompt":"Which outcome do you intend?","rationale":"The requested rebuild requires writes and would conflict with the declared read-only scope, empty writer-path list, and protected Git directory.","kind":"outcome","options":[{"id":"read_only_assessment","label":"Read-only assessment","description":"Keep the repository unchanged and request only an assessment later.","recommended":true},{"id":"authorized_rebuild","label":"Authorize rebuild","description":"Provide a new explicit writable scope and state whether Git history may be changed.","recommended":false},{"id":"different_task","label":"Different task","description":"Replace the conflicting request with a specific repository outcome.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
